wh40k-specialist-quest-capture-title = A living answer
wh40k-specialist-quest-capture-desc = Bring the marked suspect alive and handcuffed to Murochka Hawkins. Interact with Hawkins using an empty hand while the suspect is nearby.
wh40k-specialist-quest-capture-capture = Hand over the living, restrained case suspect.
wh40k-specialist-quest-signal-title = A voice behind the static
wh40k-specialist-quest-signal-desc = Decode the relay recording at the marked relay terminal. Stay still until the analysis finishes.
wh40k-specialist-quest-signal-decode = Decode the relay signal.
wh40k-specialist-quest-archive-title = An inconvenient witness
wh40k-specialist-quest-archive-desc = Analyze the archive terminal, then finish a conversation with Fio about what he heard.
wh40k-specialist-quest-archive-scan = Analyze the archive record.
wh40k-specialist-quest-archive-witness = Finish the conversation with Fio.
wh40k-specialist-quest-evidence-title = The sealed record
wh40k-specialist-quest-evidence-desc = Extract evidence at the case terminal, hold the issued chip, and submit it to Ysabel through the journal. Other chips do not count.
wh40k-specialist-quest-evidence-evidence = Submit the chip issued for this case.
wh40k-specialist-quest-imperialchoice-title = Choose Imperial
wh40k-specialist-quest-imperialchoice-desc = Finish the recipient conversation, then turn in here. This permanently selects this recipient for the signal case.
wh40k-specialist-quest-imperialchoice-decision = Confirm the approved recipient.
wh40k-specialist-quest-mechanicuschoice-title = Choose Mechanicus
wh40k-specialist-quest-mechanicuschoice-desc = Finish the recipient conversation, then turn in here. This permanently selects this recipient for the signal case.
wh40k-specialist-quest-mechanicuschoice-decision = Confirm the approved recipient.
wh40k-specialist-quest-dispatch-title = Do not break the seal
wh40k-specialist-quest-dispatch-desc = Obtain the sealed dispatch from the relay dispatch terminal and submit it to Miren. Its custody is bound to this assignment.
wh40k-specialist-quest-dispatch-sealed = Return the issued sealed dispatch.
wh40k-specialist-quest-permitfee-title = The filing fee
wh40k-specialist-quest-permitfee-desc = Hold twenty currency units and submit them at Aulus. Payment is consumed through the quest submission transaction.
wh40k-specialist-quest-permitfee-fee = Pay twenty currency units.
wh40k-specialist-quest-installation-title = One sound connection
wh40k-specialist-quest-installation-desc = Use an Imperial data chip on the installation terminal. One chip is consumed only after the work finishes.
wh40k-specialist-quest-installation-install = Install one Imperial data chip.
wh40k-specialist-quest-expedition-title = A charter for the crew
wh40k-specialist-quest-expedition-desc = The party leader accepts. A frozen party member must complete the Aivorius black-box activity. The listed rewards are your share of the crew total.
wh40k-specialist-quest-expedition-activity = Complete an Aivorius black-box expedition.
wh40k-specialist-quest-recovery-title = Recover the original
wh40k-specialist-quest-recovery-desc = Recover the actual black-box objective during the approved activity. Cleanup or a lookalike does not count.
wh40k-specialist-quest-recovery-recover = Recover the approved activity objective.
wh40k-specialist-quest-escort-title = A place beside the candle
wh40k-specialist-quest-escort-desc = Pull the marked pilgrim to Athelia. Stay within three tiles, and keep the pilgrim alive.
wh40k-specialist-quest-escort-escort = Escort the living pilgrim to Athelia.
wh40k-specialist-quest-vigil-title = Thirty seconds of peace
wh40k-specialist-quest-vigil-desc = Remain near the living marked pilgrim for thirty eligible seconds. The pilgrim must remain alive until turn-in.
wh40k-specialist-quest-vigil-protect = Guard the marked pilgrim for thirty seconds.
wh40k-specialist-quest-courier-title = Bring the courier home
wh40k-specialist-quest-courier-desc = Bring this assignment's living courier to Murochka Hawkins, then interact with Hawkins using an empty hand.
wh40k-specialist-quest-courier-deliver = Hand over the marked courier.
wh40k-specialist-quest-extraction-title = Ore with a history
wh40k-specialist-quest-extraction-desc = Extract three units of iron ore from actual veins. Bought or spawned ore never advances extraction.
wh40k-specialist-quest-extraction-extract = Extract three units of iron ore.
wh40k-specialist-quest-discovery-title = A miner's horizon
wh40k-specialist-quest-discovery-desc = Enter Foulstone after accepting this assignment. The actual sector map determines arrival.
wh40k-specialist-quest-discovery-discover = Reach the Foulstone system.
wh40k-specialist-quest-investigation-title = Follow the dock record
wh40k-specialist-quest-investigation-desc = Visit the mapped Footfall dock grid while this assignment is active.
wh40k-specialist-quest-investigation-investigate = Investigate the Footfall dock grid.
wh40k-specialist-quest-repair-title = Restore the machine
wh40k-specialist-quest-repair-desc = Repair the damaged terminal using a welding tool. A healthy terminal grants no repair credit.
wh40k-specialist-quest-repair-repair = Repair the damaged terminal.
wh40k-specialist-quest-rescue-title = Someone still waiting
wh40k-specialist-quest-rescue-desc = Heal the marked patient into a living stable state, then bring that same patient to Sera. Interact with Sera using an empty hand.
wh40k-specialist-quest-rescue-stabilize = Stabilize the marked patient by treating damage.
wh40k-specialist-quest-rescue-rescue = Hand over that living stable patient to Sera.
wh40k-specialist-quest-endurance-title = Keep breathing
wh40k-specialist-quest-endurance-desc = Remain alive in your human body for thirty eligible seconds after acceptance. Offline time and critical states do not count.
wh40k-specialist-quest-endurance-survive = Survive thirty eligible seconds.
wh40k-footfall-dialogue-lucanrho-intro = Murochka Hawkins, department chief. Take a seat if you have a case. If you have an excuse, we shall first decide which case to file it under.
wh40k-footfall-dialogue-lucanrho-service = Assignments, the Arbites, or how to make a report? One at a time: even the law only has one desk here.
wh40k-footfall-dialogue-lucanrho-tell = We serve the Lex Imperialis. This department keeps order on Footfall and handles cases easily lost between docks, merchants and competing interests. Our badge does not turn guesses into evidence. We need investigators, records and living witnesses; the last are sometimes even more useful than the first two.
wh40k-footfall-dialogue-lucanrho-pressure = Give me a moment. We must settle the record before proceeding.
wh40k-footfall-dialogue-lucanrho-accepted = Agreed. You have my word; the terms are now on record.
wh40k-footfall-dialogue-lucanrho-payoff = You came back. Thank you. Your work is recorded and the reward is due.
wh40k-footfall-dialogue-lucanrho-farewell = Take care out there. I would rather see you again than read a report about you.
wh40k-footfall-marker-lucanrho-name = Arbites chief spawn: Murochka Hawkins
wh40k-specialist-archiveterminal-name = Archive analysis terminal
wh40k-specialist-archiveterminal-desc = Read the authenticated archive record.
wh40k-specialist-signalterminal-name = Signal decoding terminal
wh40k-specialist-signalterminal-desc = Decode the relay recording.
wh40k-specialist-installationterminal-name = Component installation terminal
wh40k-specialist-installationterminal-desc = Use an Imperial data chip to complete an accepted installation.
wh40k-specialist-evidenceterminal-name = Sealed case terminal
wh40k-specialist-evidenceterminal-desc = Issues one bound evidence chip for the accepted signal case.
wh40k-specialist-dispatchterminal-name = Relay dispatch terminal
wh40k-specialist-dispatchterminal-desc = Issues one bound sealed message for an accepted assignment.
wh40k-specialist-repairterminal-name = Damaged relay terminal
wh40k-specialist-repairterminal-desc = Repair actual damage with a welding tool.
wh40k-specialist-sealedevidence-name = Sealed evidence chip
wh40k-specialist-sealedevidence-desc = The case seal identifies the assignment that issued this chip.
wh40k-specialist-sealeddispatch-name = Sealed relay dispatch
wh40k-specialist-sealeddispatch-desc = Custody is tied to the accepted assignment.
wh40k-specialist-suspect-name = Marked suspect
wh40k-specialist-suspect-desc = A living mission subject, not a hub official.
wh40k-specialist-suspect-source-name = Marked suspect source
wh40k-specialist-pilgrim-name = Waiting pilgrim
wh40k-specialist-pilgrim-desc = A pilgrim waiting for the accepted escort or vigil.
wh40k-specialist-pilgrim-source-name = Waiting pilgrim source
wh40k-specialist-patient-name = Mission patient
wh40k-specialist-patient-desc = Treat this assignment's patient, then deliver them alive.
wh40k-specialist-patient-source-name = Mission patient source
wh40k-specialist-courier-name = Missing courier
wh40k-specialist-courier-desc = Bring this mission subject back alive.
wh40k-specialist-courier-source-name = Missing courier source
wh40k-specialist-imperial-permit = Footfall Imperial permit
wh40k-specialist-mechanicus-permit = Footfall Mechanicus permit
wh40k-specialist-quest-intake-title = A record safely home
wh40k-specialist-quest-intake-desc = Hand the recovered black box to the existing Aivorius archive intake beside Fio. Other receivers cannot satisfy this assignment.
wh40k-specialist-quest-intake-objective = Hand over a recovered black box at Fio's archive intake.
